sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 participant A as Android review
 participant API as Django API
 participant W as Celery worker
 participant P as Hosted Whisper
 Note over A,P: 4B. Consent, processing and review | Unmerged integration
 Note over A,API: Precondition: server attempt known to this API.<br/>New-capture intent or explicit analysis action.
 alt First-use consent declined
  A->>A: Keep upload +<br/>local playback
 else Consent accepted / previously stored
  A->>API: POST /api/attempts/{id}/process/
  API->>API: Commit queued revision
  API-)W: Publish task via Redis after commit
  API-->>A: HTTP 202 + saved state
  par Admitted background job
  W->>W: Claim revision/token,<br/>load saved audio and partial work
  alt Saved transcript or receipt
   W->>W: Reuse saved work
  else Speech detected
   W->>P: Send original audio
   P-->>W: Timestamped words
   W->>W: Persist receipt, then transcript
  else No speech detected
   W->>W: Save empty transcript, no AI call
  end
  W->>W: Align word starts to slide visits,<br/>calculate timing metrics
  Note over A,W: Visits are [start, end) in audio-relative milliseconds.<br/>A word at a transition belongs to the new visit.<br/>Repeated/backward slide visits remain separate.
  alt Success
   W->>W: Persist completed results
  else Processing failed
   W->>W: Persist failure, retain partial results
  end
  and Foreground review
 loop Poll while processing active
  A->>API: GET /api/attempts/{id}/
  API-->>A: Saved state + available results
 end
  end
 end
 A->>A: Cache valid results,<br/>sync player + slides
 Note over A,W: Polling runs concurrently with background work.<br/>Read failure keeps cached results and offers Refresh.
 opt Recovery / retry
  Note over API,W: Beat schedules recovery through Redis.<br/>Workers requeue safe interrupted jobs.
  A->>API: Explicit retry + current processing_revision<br/>(acknowledge_uncertain if required)
  Note over A,W: Unknown submitted outcome requires confirmation.<br/>Retry preserves attempt/audio and reuses partial work.
 end
